Knowledge used, no code copied
------------------------------
* nbtevo-carplay-advanced (st1ng, https://github.com/st1ng/nbtevo-carplay-advanced): the HUDTerminal protocol and the
  6WA profile (src/hud.h); the freestanding clang + ld.lld build of LD_PRELOAD libraries and HMI plugins; the CarPlay
  route file; the HUD test channel used for the colour and layout probes.
* NBT-AAD (https://github.com/Sq00ky/Supra-iDrive6-Android-Auto): the HUDTerminal notes, the PluginApp ABI and the
  car-data (CDS) property names.
* ID6 Apps: the MOST/DSI client, and the parameters of QNX spawn() and waitpid() as their plugins call them.

